cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DODGE data or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "DODGE: an open daily screen of close approaches to Starlink satellites"
abstract: >-
  DODGE predicts, every day, every pass within 5 km between a Starlink
  satellite and any other tracked object over the next 24 hours, using SGP4
  on public CelesTrak data and operator ephemerides, and attributes each pass
  to the other object's owner, fleet and type. Raw recordings, every pass and
  daily summaries are published openly.
authors:
